    "body": "Hi, no worries.\r\n\r\nMy current `PROMPT_COMMAND` value:\r\n\r\n```\r\n_direnv_hook;__vte_prompt_command;starship_precmd;preexec_invoke_cmd\r\n```\r\nThe components are:\r\n- `_direnv_hook`: added by [direnv](https://direnv.net/)\r\n- `__vte_prompt_command`: added by the vte script from [libvte Debian package](https://packages.debian.org/bullseye/libvte-2.91-common)\r\n- `starship_precmd`: I think you already know this :wink: \r\n- `preexec_invoke_cmd`: added by [Bash-it](https://github.com/Bash-it/bash-it)",
