    "body": "Until this issue be properly fixed, I applied this simple workaround:\r\n\r\n_Adding this at the end of my `.bashrc`_\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nPROMPT_COMMAND=${PROMPT_COMMAND/;;/;}\r\n```",
